OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteer firefighter on battling
OL,4,Asummer heatwave wildfires
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews have been stretched to
OL,7,Fbreaking point this summer as wildfires
OL,8,Fspread across parts of the UK.
OL,9,FCountryside professionals have also
OL,10,Fbeen in action fighting the flames,
OL,11,Fwith their expert knowledge proving a
OL,12,Fvaluable tool in tackling the blazes.
OL,14,FGamekeeper Josh Bailey loves his job
OL,15,Fbut he has barely done it this summer -
OL,16,Finstead spending weeks battling the
OL,17,Fraging wildfires that have ignited
OL,18,Faround the country.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
