OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteer firefighter on battling
OL,4,Asummer heatwave wildfires
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs well as his 'normal' role the
OL,7,F33-year-old is also a trained
OL,8,Ffirefighter and is one of many
OL,9,Fvolunteers across the country who have
OL,10,Fbeen called on to help tackle the
OL,11,Fblazes.
OL,13,FAfter putting himself at risk for weeks
OL,14,Fhe says he is in disbelief about people
OL,15,Fwho continue to ignore safety warnings.
